tool.help:
NCBI EGAPx execute
==================

What it does
============

Annotates a eukaryotic genome assembly with `EGAPx <https://github.com/ncbi/egapx>`_ using a local cache of support data (EGAPx *offline mode*).

Inputs:

- **EGAPx configuration YAML**: either the **EGAPx configuration** dataset emitted by **NCBI EGAPx prepare input** (when prepared with the tool form) or the same history YAML configuration given to **NCBI EGAPx prepare input**.
- **EGAPx local cache**: the cache produced by **NCBI EGAPx prepare input** for that configuration (including any staged history/indexed datasets).

The SRA query limit in *Developer options* applies to SRA Entrez queries in the configuration.
To download and annotate in one step, use **NCBI EGAPx**.

